    "Je modifie": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm editing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je modifie un fichier": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm editing a file"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai aucun moteur pour réfléchir : installe Claude Code et connecte-toi (claude, puis /login), ou ajoute une clé Anthropic, OpenAI ou Gemini, ou lance Ollama : réglages, section Moteurs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I have no engine to think with: install Claude Code and log in (claude, then /login), or add an Anthropic, OpenAI or Gemini key, or start Ollama: Settings, Engines."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai aucun moteur pour réfléchir. Installe Claude Code (puis « claude » et /login), ou ajoute une clé Anthropic, OpenAI ou Gemini, ou lance Ollama : réglages, section Moteurs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I have no engine to think with. Install Claude Code (then \"claude\" and /login), or add an Anthropic, OpenAI or Gemini key, or start Ollama: Settings, Engines."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai pas compris la réponse. Redemande-moi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I didn't understand the answer. Ask me again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai pas le détail. Il est dans la session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I don't have the details. They're in the session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai pas pu : %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai pas pu garder l'accès : %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't keep access: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai pas pu les retirer : %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't remove them: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai pas pu lire les réglages de Claude Code : %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't read Claude Code's settings: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai pas pu écrire %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't write %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai pas réussi à lire ça. Pour ton agenda, tes rappels et ton temps libre, demande-moi un jour précis, d'aujourd'hui à dans quatorze jours, par exemple « qu'est-ce que j'ai demain ? » ou « combien de temps libre jeudi ? ».": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't read that. For your calendar, reminders and free time, ask me about a specific day, from today to fourteen days ahead, for example \"what do I have tomorrow?\" or \"how much free time on Thursday?\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'ai rien trouvé à dire. Redemande-moi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I found nothing to say. Ask me again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'arrive pas à créer le dossier où travailler.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't create the folder to work in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'arrive pas à joindre GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't reach GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'arrive pas à joindre GitHub. Je réessaie dans un moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't reach GitHub. I'll try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'arrive pas à joindre le réseau.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't reach the network."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'arrive pas à voir le ciel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't see the sky."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je n'en ai pas le droit, alors je n'ai rien fait.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm not allowed to, so I didn't do anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne garde que ce que tu m'as dit, sur ce Mac. Tu peux tout relire, corriger ou effacer dans l'île.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I only keep what you've told me, on this Mac. You can read, fix or erase everything in the island."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne le connais pas encore": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I don't know it yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne peux pas : %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne peux pas le faire, alors je ne t'ai rien demandé : %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't do it, so I didn't ask you anything: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne peux pas lire %@. Je n'y ai pas touché.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't read %@. I didn't touch it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne peux pas te demander ton accord maintenant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't ask for your approval right now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne sais encore rien de toi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I don't know anything about you yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne sais pas encore faire ça, alors je n'ai rien touché. Pour l'instant je sais créer un fichier (dans Téléchargements, sur ton Bureau ou dans Documents) et ajouter du texte à ceux que j'ai créés, ajouter un rappel ou un événement à ton calendrier, lancer un Focus et te dire ce que tu as aujourd'hui.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't do that yet, so I didn't touch anything. For now I can create a file (in Downloads, on your Desktop or in Documents) and add text to the ones I created, add a reminder or an event to your calendar, start a Focus session and tell you what you have today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne sais pas encore faire ça. Rien n'a été fait.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't do that yet. Nothing was done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne sais pas exactement ce que cette action toucherait.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I don't know exactly what this action would touch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne sais pas faire ça dans cette version, alors je n'ai rien touché.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't do that in this version, so I didn't touch anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne sais pas où tu es.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I don't know where you are."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne suis pas encore prêt, réessaie dans un instant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm not ready yet, try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne surveille rien pour l'instant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm not watching anything right now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne vois ni ton agenda, ni tes rappels, ni la météo. Active-les dans mes réglages et je te dirai.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't see your calendar, your reminders or the weather. Turn them on in my settings and I'll tell you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne vois pas tes sessions Claude Code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't see your Claude Code sessions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne vois pas ton GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't see your GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne vois pas ton agenda.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't see your calendar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je parle de moi-même": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I speak up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je peux suivre tes sessions Claude Code. Je m'installe ?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can follow your Claude Code sessions. Shall I set myself up?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je regarde le ciel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking at the sky."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je regarde tes dépôts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking at your repositories."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je regarde une fois par jour sur GitHub. Je ne télécharge et n'installe jamais rien tout seul.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I check GitHub once a day. I never download or install anything on my own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je réessaie dans un moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je réfléchis": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm thinking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je réponds": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm answering"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je résume, j'envoie ou je range. Tu choisis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I summarise, send or file it. You choose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je suis déjà sur une autre tâche. Redemande-moi juste après.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm already on another task. Ask me again right after."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je te rappelle dans %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll call you back in %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je vois quelle app et quelle fenêtre tu utilises, pour parler à propos. Ça reste sur ce Mac, en mémoire : pas de capture d'écran, pas de frappe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I see which app and window you're using, so I can speak to the point. It stays on this Mac, in memory: no screenshots, no keystrokes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jeton d'accès": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Access token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Joindre cette fenêtre à ton message": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attach this window to your message"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Juste ton prénom. Je le garde pour moi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Just your first name. I'll keep it to myself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'installation d'Apple s'ouvre. Reviens ici quand elle est finie.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple's installer is opening. Come back here when it's done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'écriture a échoué : %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writing failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La CI ne passe plus : %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CI is failing: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La la la": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La la la"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La liste arrive après la première lecture de GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The list comes after the first look at GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La nouvelle langue s'applique au prochain lancement de Yumi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The new language applies the next time Yumi starts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La pause attend aussi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The break can wait too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La pull request « Accueil plus calme » est fusionnée.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
