    "Works only when asked. Plans with Claude Code (no tools, your Claude Code login) or else the Anthropic key above; creating a file always asks first. What is on screen stays on the Mac unless you tick the box.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works only when asked. Plans with Claude Code (no tools, your Claude Code login) or else the Anthropic key above; creating a file always asks first. What is on screen stays on the Mac unless you tick the box."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ne travaille que sur demande. Planifie avec Claude Code (sans outils, ta connexion Claude Code) ou sinon la clé Anthropic ; créer un fichier demande toujours avant. Ce qui est à l'écran reste sur le Mac sauf si tu coches la case."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yumi": {
